ttps://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/16108.\r\n\r\nSimple repro - 3-region cluster with one node located in `cloud.region1.zone`:\r\n\r\n```sql\r\ncreate tablespace ts with (replica_placement='{\"num_replicas\" : 1, \"placement_blocks\" : [{\"cloud\" : \"cloud\", \"region\" : \"region1\", \"zone\" : \"zone\", \"min_num_replicas\" : 1}]}');\r\n\r\ncreate table global_table(x int primary key);\r\ncreate table partitioned_table(x int, y int, z int) partition by list (y);\r\ncreate table a_partition partition of partitioned_table(x, y, z references global_table(x), primary key(x, y)) for values in (1) tablespace ts;\r\n\r\ninsert into global_table values(1);\r\n\r\nbegin; \r\ninsert into partitioned_table values(1, 1, 1);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe insert is converted into two operations - a PGSQL_WRITE on a tablet in `a_partition` and a PGSQL_READ on a tablet in `global_table`. This transaction is started as local, but necessitates a promotion immediately due to the PGSQL_READ on a tablet in `global_table`. As a result of #16108 and #17113 this results in the transaction getting aborted and triggering a tserver crash.\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-6399]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6399?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":9213757396,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc5k0mJszwAAAAIlLsfU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/9213757396","actor":{"login":"yugaby